  id: honey_bee
  displayName: Honey Bee
  description: Common pollinator. Beekeeper archetype's primary resource.
  behaviors:
  - Lives in Apiaries and wild Honey Hives.
  - Friendly to player wearing Beekeeper Suit.
  - "Aggressive otherwise \u2014 swarm attacks."
  - Used as ammo for Bee Cannon, transport for Bee Courier Hive.
  habitat: Marsh Fauna
  dropItemIds:
  - Honey x1 (from hive harvest)
  - Beeswax x1
  - Royal Jelly x1 (rare)
